re final exact-head artifacts/review bind this child and the still-open parent through the existing guarded mechanism only when every parent condition is satisfied. If that requires a concrete closure-plan correction, resolve it before the final merge rather than leaving the parent silently open or closing it on partial work.\n\nCurrent source: [current schema/profile](internal/workroom/schema.go@359b211cfe94e758db592d6e4e78c2f85c6c9c30:16), [branch-ref validation](internal/workroom/landing.go@359b211cfe94e758db592d6e4e78c2f85c6c9c30:121).","body":{"branch":"request/validated-checkout-branch-fields","conditions":"S3: deliver validated branch display fields and complete the parent outcome. Deliver the assigned adopted stage and its stated controls, current source/architecture reconciliation, independent exact-head review, guarded landing, push/CI and owned cleanup. Preserve the full parent outcome and all protected operational boundaries described in the request.","head":"359b211cfe94e758db592d6e4e78c2f85c6c9c30","stale_bases":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:2fe3893fa5f7834a0d0e26d70407710cf2af1826, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:64a889b38b2ef5aeba01d537e7221858a0131662, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:7a71886b58aae707adfad0e1f4f98e6f464c6577, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:a601bafd0a9e491a4a81ed23eacd0f2d287803fd, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:ac54fe712abc7ca0614ca1067bad1a7ff8c490b0, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:b035cfef4ca156fba09586ab10c1b9910a341b79, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:c46878654036799e0c456e33fea10e7c04c85b7f stale; describes a superseded world; retired bases: git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:005460183c819676fead7d19fdd20633b48dc16c, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:00ded1b22f0fb16f85f5770e269c04a8dfb3212